# multiagents managed layout

Ansible-managed by the `multiagents` role (`multiagents_state={{ multiagents_state }}`).

## Purpose

This directory is the **repo-owned scaffold root** for multiagents on this host.
Package install is separate (`bun install -g {{ multiagents_package_name }}@{{ multiagents_version }}`).
Client wiring (Codex, Cursor, Claude, Gemini) and scenario packs are **deferred**.

## Layout (may change)

| Path | Intent |
| --- | --- |
| `data/` | Reserved for future runtime/DB state if we move off the upstream default |
| `scenarios/` | Placeholder for future per-client / per-scenario config packs |
| `README.md` | This file |

Layout is intentionally not frozen. If multi-config support needs a different
tree (profiles, clients, ports, env files), change the role defaults and
re-apply — do not treat this first scaffold as sacred.

## Upstream defaults (not managed yet)

- Broker port: `{{ multiagents_broker_port }}`
- Default DB: `{{ multiagents_upstream_db_default }}`
- Upstream: https://github.com/zetbrush/multiagents

## Out of scope for this pass

- `multiagents setup`
- Broker start/stop
- MCP config writes into Codex / Cursor / Claude / Gemini
- Scenario profiles
